      <name>
        <baseName xml:lang="en">Inert natural mix from Lombardy Region</baseName>
      </name>
      <common:synonyms>Estrazione mistone naturale </common:synonyms>
      <classificationInformation>
        <common:classification name="ILCDCategories" classes="../ILCDClassification.xml">
          <common:class level="0">Materials production</common:class>
          <common:class level="1">Non-energetic raw materials</common:class>
        </common:classification>
      </classificationInformation>
      <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Dataset developed within the ARCADIA project in the context of the PhD of Federica Carollo (Politecnico di Milano). &#13;
&#13;
The dataset relates to extracting a tonne of the natural mixture from a sand and gravel quarry in the Lombardy Region. &#13;
The dataset is composed of 3-unit processes:  &#13;
1) Input or sand and gravel; &#13;
2) Diesel consumption for the extraction; &#13;
3) Transport to final use (average sale distance). </common:generalComment>
      <referenceToExternalDocumentation type="source data set" refObjectId="c32fb302-6dd2-49a7-a160-377d3b91312c" version="01.00.000" uri="../sources/c32fb302-6dd2-49a7-a160-377d3b91312c.xml">
        <common:shortDescription>Carollo F. (2023). Circularity in construction and demolition waste management chain, Ph.D. Dissertation (Tutored by Rigamonti L., Ceruti F.). Politecnico di Milano. Background datasets from the EcoInvent database cut-off (v. 3.8) were used for the LCA study. &#13;
</common:shortDescription>
      </referenceToExternalDocumentation>
    </dataSetInformation>
